            "review_title": "Review at SalaThai",
            "review_text": "majormurph\nBengaluru, India34 contributions\n2\nBest Thai food in Vietnam!\nNov 2023 • Friends\nThis is about the best Thai food our group of 10 has ever eaten and matches with the best in Thailand. Most of our group of foodies has travelled to Thailand multiple times, and one is an expert on Thai food..…and we all agreed that this was among the top 5 thai restaurants we’d ever eaten at. It’s only one year old and that is why there are so few reviews. We ate here on Day 1 of our stay in Hanoi and again on day 3, which was our last meal at the end of a 11 day Vietnam trip. We would come here again in a heartbeat to eat the absolutely delicious food. And super friendly and polite service!\nRead more\nWritten November 24, 2023",
