            "review_title": "Review at SalaThai",
            "review_text": "Tuân\nHanoi, Vietnam1 contribution\n1\nBEST THAI RESTAURANT IN HANOI\nOct 2023\nSala Thai is located at 20 Duong Thanh, Cua Dong, Hoan Kiem, Hanoi, and is open daily from 1000-2200. It is around 800 meters 10 minutes walk from Hoan Kiem Lake.\nThis lovely thai restaurant offers a variety of delicious thai foods like shrimp or papaya salad, tom yam, and many more for you to choose from (Pad Thai, Tomyum soup, Curry ...)\n\nI hand order curry chicken with rice, fried cabbage and ice green tea. The cabbage smoky flavor is nice, the curry not so spicy, and the combination with the rice is marvelous. The ice green tea is ok and not too sweet\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 9, 2023",
